.TH "PWUNCONV" "8" "04/19/2025" "shadow\-utils 4\&.17\&.4" "دستورهای مدیریت سیستم (System Management Commands)"
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * Define some portability stuff
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
